graph TD
    Request[Incoming Request] --> Method{HTTP method?}
    Method -->|GET| Allow[200 OK<br/>read-only, no auth]
    Method -->|POST / PATCH / DELETE| Header{Authorization header?}
    Header -->|missing or malformed| Unauth[401 unauthorized]
    Header -->|Bearer present| Validate{token matches<br/>TRACKER_API_TOKEN?}
    Validate -->|no| Forbid[403 forbidden]
    Validate -->|yes| Route[execute mutation]
    Route --> Audit[skill_events row]
    subgraph TokenSource[Token storage]
        TokenFile[/opt/homeserver/ottomate/.token<br/>chmod 600]
        EnvVar[$TRACKER_API_TOKEN in .env]
    end
    TokenSource -.->|loaded at boot| Validate
